# A12.1 built-in keystore2 is intentionally DISABLED.
# - It links libvintf@4.0, which cannot parse the baked stock A15 device VINTF
#   manifest (version 5.0) -> getDeviceHalManifest -22 -> SIGSEGV crash-loop.
# - It races keystore2-unisoc (A15, /crypto/bin/sys/keystore2) for the
#   android.system.keystore2 binder service, panicking one of the two.
# The A15 keystore2 is started from keymint_unisoc.rc (keystore2-unisoc).